b/ref 1071 "Consider the straight line given by the following parametric equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x=13-8t \\\\ y=7t \\\\ z=-7-3t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhat would be the vector equation of the line?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400296 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "36cc5d87-ef5c-5ced-b253-0194de848513" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400296 #edb/ref 1074 "These parametric equations are equivalent to \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}13-8t \\\\ 7t \\\\ -7-3t\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-8t \\\\ 7t \\\\ -3t\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ r & =[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400298 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400299 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400301 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400302 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186400298 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400297 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "9a9d6e6e-8fef-5299-a849-0aa77d8da6d2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400298 #edb/ref 1080 "r=[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400298 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400298 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "564ee336-e66d-5546-97d6-8fa612ba327d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400299 #edb/ref 1080 "r=[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400299 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400299 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "dcf4a053-3cd4-584a-b71e-fe1605fc70cf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400300 #edb/ref 1080 "r=[\\begin{aligned}-13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400300 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400300 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c2e1049f-5e1d-5b3c-8391-3499c9f2c5a0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400301 #edb/ref 1080 "r=[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400301 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400301 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "53472021-3d4c-5834-b0ba-da5f2ec5ecc8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400302 #edb/ref 1080 "r=[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400302 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400302 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b8951647-7a26-5c84-98de-64516b4ad097" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400303 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186400304 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400303 #edb/ref 1069 "q-127373" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400303 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400303 #edb/ref 1071 "A deck contains $10$ cards labeled with the numbers $4$, $7$, $10,…,31.$ If one card is randomly drawn from the deck, what is its expected value?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400303 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "38dbfb09-c609-5f82-9c41-6942da640f6a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400303 #edb/ref 1074 "The expected value of a discrete random variable $X$ with probability mass function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nLet $X$ be the number on a randomly drawn card. Then the support is $S=\\{4,7,10,…,31\\},$ and the corresponding probabilities are all $\\frac{1}{10}:$\n\n$$\nf(4)=f(7)=f(10)=…=f(31)=\\frac{1}{10}\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =4\\cdot f(4)+7\\cdot f(7)+10\\cdot f(10)+…+31\\cdot f(10) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{10}+\\frac{7}{10}+\\frac{10}{10}+…+\\frac{31}{10} \\\\  & =\\frac{4+7+10+13+16+19+22+25+28+31}{10} \\\\  & =\\frac{175}{10} \\\\  & =17.5\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400305 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400306 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400307 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400308 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400309 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186400309 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400304 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "976a52a5-b179-5232-a723-a916fc10fd46" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
